 addresses\\n     \"},\"yieldToken()\":{\"notice\":\"returns the address of the underlying yield token\\n     \"},\"getTokensIn()\":{\"notice\":\"returns all tokens that can mint this SY\\n     \"},\"getTokensOut()\":{\"notice\":\"returns all tokens that can be redeemed by this SY\\n     \"},\"assetInfo()\":{\"notice\":\"This function contains information to interpret what the asset is\"}},\"notice\":\"Both standard nine-decimal wrappers, with R3 principal-denominated staking SY. burns actual SY-held issued shares; it is bearer principal, not an owner ticket or underlying donation. Checkpoint old holders before share changes. Self-held earnings belong to protocol U. Staking rate=1e18, assetInfo=(TOKEN,parent,9), yieldToken=receipt; raw yieldToken=parent. Staking reward tokens=[RT], index=[1+1e36-k], accrued/claim/event amounts are native RT. claimRewards requires activation even for zero. Self accrued/claim returns [0] when callable. Raw SY retains rawBacking=shares and empty reward arrays, without automatic receipt routes.\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"contracts/vaults/detf/protocols/dexes/uniswap/v4/migration/sy/IUniswapV4DetfMigrationSY.sol\":\"IUniswapV4DetfMigrationSY\"},\"evmVersion\":\"osaka\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":1},\"remappings\":[\"@battlechain-contracts/=lib/crane/lib/battlechain-lib/lib/battlechain-safe-harbor-contracts/src/\",\"@crane/=lib/crane/\",\"@matterlabs/=lib/crane/lib/battlechain-lib/lib/battlechain-safe-harbor-contracts/lib/battlechain-contracts/lib/\",\"@nomicfoundation/=node_modules/@nomicfoundation/\",\"@opengsn/=node_modules/@opengsn/\",\"@openzeppelin/=node_modules/@openzeppelin/\",\"@oz/=lib/crane/lib/openzeppelin-contracts/\",\"@ozu/=lib/crane/contracts/external/openzeppelin-upgradeable/\",\"battlechain-contracts/=lib/crane/lib/battlechain-lib/lib/battlechain-safe-harbor-contracts/lib/battlechain-contracts/\",\"battlechain-lib-mocks/